      "id": "heisenberg-1925",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 220,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Über quantentheoretische Umdeutung kinematischer und mechanischer Beziehungen.\",\n  \"alias\": \"Heisenberg · 可观测量与矩阵力学\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"- 从可观测的跃迁量出发重建量子运动学。\\n- 适合追问：经典轨道图像为何失效？\",\n  \"url\": \"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/BF01328377\",\n  \"year\": 1925\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "schrodinger-1926",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 220,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Quantisierung als Eigenwertproblem\",\n  \"alias\": \"Schrödinger · 波动力学\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"- 以本征值问题处理量子能级。\\n- 此处链接第一篇，不能与同年后续三篇混为一篇。\",\n  \"url\": \"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/andp.19263840404\",\n  \"year\": 1926\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "born-1926",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Zur Quantenmechanik der Stoßvorgänge\",\n  \"alias\": \"Born · 散射与概率解释\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"- 从散射过程理解波函数与跃迁。\\n- 区分量子态的演化和观测结果的统计。\",\n  \"url\": \"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/BF01397477\",\n  \"year\": 1926\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "dirac-1928",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"The Quantum Theory of the Electron\",\n  \"alias\": \"Dirac · 相对论性电子理论\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"- 寻求兼容量子论与相对论的电子方程。\\n- 阅读时关注自旋结构如何从理论中出现。\",\n  \"url\": \"https://royalsocietypublishing.org/doi/10.1098/rspa.1928.0023\",\n  \"year\": 1928\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "epr-1935",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Can Quantum-Mechanical Description of Physical Reality Be Considered Complete?\",\n  \"alias\": \"EPR · 完备性问题\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"- 通过关联体系讨论量子描述的完备性。\\n- 将可预测性、实在性和完备性的条件分开阅读。\",\n  \"url\": \"https://journals.aps.org/pr/abstract/10.1103/PhysRev.47.777\",\n  \"year\": 1935\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "bell-1964",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1680,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"On the Einstein Podolsky Rosen paradox\",\n  \"alias\": \"Bell · 局域性与可检验约束\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"- 延续 EPR 提出的问题，研究局域理论的约束。\\n- 区分原始论文论证与后来的实验检验。\",\n  \"url\": \"https://journals.aps.org/ppf/abstract/10.1103/PhysicsPhysiqueFizika.1.195\",\n  \"year\": 1964\n}\n```"
    }
